  + current reconciliation must independently rederive both complete carriers and return Equal
  + Equal remains subordinate and never substitutes for acquisition or order proof
  + intermediate, later, external-writer, quiescence, atomicity, and snapshot claims remain absent

& [ClockAndOrderAudit] prevents accidental effect activation
  + source mentions later bounded start and completion evidence but does not select a clock API, field layout, or read operation
  + canonical formation may require an abstract exact causal order edge without designing a clock-bearing runtime form
  + any concrete clock domain, tick field, deadline read, freshness evaluator, or platform API requires later separately preserved source
  + therefore no source correction is required and clock authority remains absent

& [ProfileAudit] passes with an explicit interpretation
  + scanner profile 0.1 identifies the unchanged no-follow observation and traversal policy
  + forms and receipt profiles 0.3 identify the changed machine representation
  + no scanner executable exists whose compatibility is being promised
