  + any later change to traversal behavior, platform surface, or issued scanner profile requires new source

& [IssuanceSeparationAudit] passes
  + public receipt construction and validation remain pure structural operations
  + evidence derivation requires acquisition and reconciliation lineages
  + receipt issuance requires a separately authorized scanner issuer that binds all receipt fields and evidence edges
  + consumption and freshness evaluation remain later M2E authority
  + neither form validity nor formation signature proves issuer identity, acquisition occurrence, or physical truth

